{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/5039","id":1601416133,"node_id":"PR_kwDOELj1_s5fc6vF","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/pull/5039","diff_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/pull/5039.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/pull/5039.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/5039","number":5039,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"fix(server): fix regression introduced by #5017","user":{"login":"jussisaurio","id":22619982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio","html_url":"https://github.com/jussisaurio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #5037\r\n\r\n## 🎯 Changes\r\n\r\nThere were two bug reports about 10.43.3, the cause of which can be traced back to PR #5017 (which fixed another inference bug... seeing a pattern here)\r\n\r\nI _think_ in both bug reports the cause has something to do with using generics to construct either tRPC instances or tRPC middlewares using a type parameter that is not constrained to `object`, which causes TS to infer incompatible types for middleware builders after `Overwrite` was changed to only do the key-wise merge on types that extend `object`.\r\n\r\nThis PR basically reverts the changes in #5017 and replaces it with a check to see whether `TWith` (the type that overwrites the target type) extends a JS primitive, and if so, wholly replaces it. This achieves the intended end result of #5017 while (hopefully) fixing the issues introduced in 10.43.3 and reported in #5037.\r\n\r\nThis PR includes a test with which I was able to reproduce a compile error similar to the one(s) reported in #5037, and which was fixed with the added changes.\r\n\r\n## ✅ Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] I have followed the steps listed in the [Contributing guide](https://github.com/trpc/trpc/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\r\n- [ ] If necessary, I have added documentation related to the changes made.\r\n- [x] I have added or updated the tests related to the changes made.\r\n","created_at":"2023-11-14T20:25:58Z","updated_at":"2023-12-17T12:02:10Z","closed_at":"2023-11-17T11:37:49Z","merged_at":"2023-11-17T11:37:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"de8589879a461dc107402cd2fb1b06919a6c1c69","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":2728304521,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzI4MzA0NTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/labels/@trpc/server","name":"@trpc/server","color":"9BE78E","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/5039/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/5039/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/5039/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/statuses/a2a14f0fb131bc8f06573a62d18bdd6f920a120b","head":{"label":"trpc:fix-5037","ref":"fix-5037","sha":"a2a14f0fb131bc8f06573a62d18bdd6f920a120b","user":{"login":"trpc","id":78011399,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc4MDExMzk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78011399?v=